LiteRT 4be73079f (2026-11-11) "Only import AHardwareBuffers on Arm OpenCL
devices that support it", verbatim (`git show --format= 4be73079f`).
patch_c_api.sh section 10b adds it to the litert archive. Without it the
OpenCL path imports AHardwareBuffers on Exynos/Xclipse GPUs, which crashes
with SIGSEGV (LiteRT-LM #4423; 0.20 migration D11). Drop it once the LiteRT pin
contains 4be73079f.

